{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛テスト勉強中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/16/9465696/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/16/9465696/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/16/9465696/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋は栗！\n栗しか食べないんだからっ←\n栗きんとん。じゅるり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは秋の食べ物\n何がすきですか⁇\nまつぼっくりはなしね笑\n食べ物じゃないよあすか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/16/9465696/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/16/9465696/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日レッスン前に\nまあやに三つ編みより細かい\nフィッシュボーン編んでもらった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/16/9465696/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当、魚のホネみたいだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/16/9465696/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやすごい！\n頭なでなでしたら照れてた。\nかわいいなちくしょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キンモクセイ香りがしました。\n朝家から学校まで歩くときに\n気持ちが良いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし鼻ムズムズして\nくしゃみが止まらん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花粉症つらいよーーーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/16/9465696/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/16/9465696/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21日は長野県におじゃまします♪\n楽しみだよーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/16/9465696/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}